    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758560/extras/05d7c161070a5b631b121344b5819ae0.poster.avif?t=1752630105\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758560/extras/05d7c161070a5b631b121344b5819ae0.webm?t=1752630105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758560/extras/05d7c161070a5b631b121344b5819ae0.mp4?t=1752630105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Abyssal Drift</strong> is a minimalist 1-bit puzzle game where you control a lone jellyfish on a mysterious journey through the abyssal depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: find the hidden key in each stage to unlock the door that leads to even deeper areas. But don\u2019t be fooled \u2014 with each level, the puzzles become more challenging and the obstacles more treacherous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your moves, overcome traps, and find the right path so you don\u2019t get lost in the darkness. With its minimalist aesthetic and hypnotic atmosphere, <i>Abyssal Drift</i> combines strategy, patience, and precision in a unique nostalgic experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the courage to open every door and reach the bottom of the abyss?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758560/extras/9fa36a13a3d524d2c426e12fbce12042.poster.avif?t=1752630105\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758560/extras/9fa36a13a3d524d2c426e12fbce12042.webm?t=1752630105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758560/extras/9fa36a13a3d524d2c426e12fbce12042.mp4?t=1752630105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 1-bit visuals with retro charm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Challenging puzzles that evolve with each stage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Immersive, minimalist atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Simple and intuitive mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Progression through hidden doors in the depths</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758560/extras/05d7c161070a5b631b121344b5819ae0.poster.avif?t=1752630105\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758560/extras/05d7c161070a5b631b121344b5819ae0.webm?t=1752630105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758560/extras/05d7c161070a5b631b121344b5819ae0.mp4?t=1752630105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Abyssal Drift</strong> is a minimalist 1-bit puzzle game where you control a lone jellyfish on a mysterious journey through the abyssal depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: find the hidden key in each stage to unlock the door that leads to even deeper areas. But don\u2019t be fooled \u2014 with each level, the puzzles become more challenging and the obstacles more treacherous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your moves, overcome traps, and find the right path so you don\u2019t get lost in the darkness. With its minimalist aesthetic and hypnotic atmosphere, <i>Abyssal Drift</i> combines strategy, patience, and precision in a unique nostalgic experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the courage to open every door and reach the bottom of the abyss?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758560/extras/9fa36a13a3d524d2c426e12fbce12042.poster.avif?t=1752630105\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758560/extras/9fa36a13a3d524d2c426e12fbce12042.webm?t=1752630105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758560/extras/9fa36a13a3d524d2c426e12fbce12042.mp4?t=1752630105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 1-bit visuals with retro charm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Challenging puzzles that evolve with each stage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Immersive, minimalist atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Simple and intuitive mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Progression through hidden doors in the depths</p></li></ul>",
